    "task": "image-classification",
    "description": "A ViT-Base model fine-tuned on FER2013 and converted by ONNX Community for local Transformers.js inference. It assigns a face image probabilities for seven facial-expression classes.",
    "intendedUses": [
      "Research and educational exploration of facial-expression classification.",
      "Benchmark browser image classification across ONNX variants.",
      "Add non-consequential expression tags to user-reviewed media workflows."
    ],
    "limitations": [
      "A facial expression is not reliable evidence of a person's internal emotional state, intent, truthfulness, or mental health.",
      "The reported source accuracy is 71.55% on FER2013, and performance varies across demographic groups.",
      "The model expects a clear, centered, front-facing face and can fail with multiple faces, profiles, occlusion, poor lighting, blur, or non-photographic images.",
      "FER2013 contains low-resolution, noisy labels and only seven coarse classes.",
      "Do not use this model for biometric identification, surveillance, employment, education, health, law enforcement, or other consequential decisions."
    ]
  },
